# build/ is scratch, except the data the paper is computed from: the trajectories of every paid
# run, the frozen splits themselves (task directories and negative controls, so the exact targets
# graded in the paper are available without rebuilding; `rea-arena freeze --verify` checks them
# against the manifest), the shortcut battery outputs, the solver sweep and the figures.
build/*
!build/phase3/
!build/phase3-grok-sens/
!build/phase3-opus-retry/
!build/phase4/
!build/phase4_clear/
!build/bench-core-v1/
!build/validity-mq/
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
paper/*.pdf
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
